        dct:description "Vendors `datasets/carrier_driven_canalization/` with 4 primary BibTeX entries and verified DOIs (`10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.03.017`, `10.1101/gad.1402406`, `10.1111/j.1365-313X.2005.02581.x`, `10.1371/journal.pcbi.1000207`), `scout_manifest.json`, `carrier_driven_canalization_reference.json`, and `leaf_tip_venation_loops_specimen.jpg`, all verified at runtime via SHA-256 checksums (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L79-92)." ;
